---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Business Automation and Custom Software Pricing | Static Pulse Sites"
  description="Review starting prices for custom website development, AI automation services, and custom internal software for small and medium businesses."
>
  <main class="pricing-page">
    <section class="pricing-hero">
      <div class="container pricing-hero-inner">
        <h1>Simple starting prices for practical business systems</h1>

        <p>
          Every project is scoped around the business problem, the work
          required, and the systems involved. The prices below provide a clear
          starting point before we review your specific requirements.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="pricing-grid">
          <article class="pricing-card">
            <div>
              <p class="pricing-label">Website Development</p>

              <h2>Starting at $1,500</h2>

              <p>
                This starting price is intended for a focused small business
                website where the client already has a clear creative direction,
                branding, content, and examples of the desired style.
              </p>

              <p>
                The final price increases when the project requires a new visual
                direction, substantial content organization, custom layouts,
                advanced integrations, a website migration, or broader SEO
                implementation.
              </p>

              <ul>
                <li>Custom-coded responsive website</li>
                <li>Client-owned source code</li>
                <li>Contact or enquiry forms</li>
                <li>Basic metadata and technical setup</li>
                <li>Mobile and performance review</li>
                <li>Launch and hosting configuration</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <a
              class="pricing-link"
              href="/services/website-development"
              aria-label="Learn more about Website Development"
            >
              Learn about Website Development →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="pricing-card">
            <div>
              <p class="pricing-label">AI Systems &amp; Automation</p>

              <h2>Starting at $1,500</h2>

              <p>
                This starting price applies to one clearly defined workflow
                involving a limited number of platforms, triggers, actions, and
                conditions.
              </p>

              <p>
                The final price depends on how many systems need to connect, how
                complex the workflow is, whether approvals or document handling
                are required, and whether AI capabilities are included.
              </p>

              <ul>
                <li>Workflow mapping and planning</li>
                <li>Platform and tool integrations</li>
                <li>Automated notifications and updates</li>
                <li>Lead, document, or task workflows</li>
                <li>Testing and error handling</li>
                <li>Optional AI-assisted functions</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <a
              class="pricing-link"
              href="/services/ai-systems-automation"
              aria-label="Learn more about AI Systems and Automation"
            >
              Learn about AI Systems &amp; Automation →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="pricing-card">
            <div>
              <p class="pricing-label">Custom Internal Software</p>

              <h2>Starting at $2,000</h2>

              <p>
                This starting price is intended for a focused internal tool that
                solves one clearly defined operational problem with a limited
                number of users, screens, records, and workflow steps.
              </p>

              <p>
                The final price increases when the project requires multiple
                user roles, advanced permissions, client access, integrations,
                document management, reporting, AI capabilities, or complex
                data relationships.
              </p>

              <ul>
                <li>Custom CRM or internal tool</li>
                <li>Client or employee portal</li>
                <li>Operations dashboard</li>
                <li>Workflow and status tracking</li>
                <li>Role-based user access</li>
                <li>Ongoing feature expansion</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <a
              class="pricing-link"
              href="/services/custom-internal-software"
              aria-label="Learn more about Custom Internal Software"
            >
              Learn about Custom Internal Software →
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing-final-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="pricing-final-cta">
          <h2>Get a price based on the problem you need to solve</h2>

          <p>
            Tell us about your business, the tools you currently use, and what
            you want to improve. We will review your request and respond by
            email with the appropriate next step.
          </p>

          <div class="pricing-button-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
              Start Your Project
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .pricing-page {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .pricing-hero {
    padding: clamp(3.25rem, 5vw, 5rem) 0
      clamp(2.75rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }

  .pricing-hero-inner {
    max-width: 1050px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pricing-hero h1 {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .pricing-hero p {
    max-width: 790px;
    margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pricing-section {
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 3.5vw, 3.75rem) 0;
  }

  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
  }

  .pricing-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 2.8vw, 2.4rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top right,
        rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08),
        transparent 36%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
      );
  }

  .pricing-label {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .pricing-card h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pricing-card p:not(.pricing-label) {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .pricing-card ul {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .pricing-card li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .pricing-link {
    display: inline-block;
    padding-top: 1.35rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    transition:
      color 180ms ease,
      transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .pricing-link:hover,
  .pricing-link:focus-visible {
    color: #2ad2ef;
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .pricing-note-section {
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 3vw, 3.25rem) 0;
  }

  .pricing-note {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pricing-note h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pricing-note > p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .pricing-service-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .pricing-service-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    transition:
      color 180ms ease,
      border-color 180ms ease,
      background-color 180ms ease,
      transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .pricing-service-links a:hover,
  .pricing-service-links a:focus-visible {
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .pricing-final-section {
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 3vw, 3.25rem) 0
      clamp(3rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }

  .pricing-final-cta {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top right,
        rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12),
        transparent 38%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045),
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
      );
  }

  .pricing-final-cta h2 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .pricing-final-cta > p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pricing-button-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .pricing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .pricing-hero,
    .pricing-section {
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .pricing-note-section {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .pricing-card {
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .pricing-service-links {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .pricing-service-links a {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .pricing-final-section {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .pricing-final-cta {
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }
  }
</style>